n\nThis does not explain ClubLogistics, its target user, or its equipment\ntracking purpose to project visitors.\n\nLet\u0027s replace the sample text with a product overview, key capabilities,\nand links to the project documentation.\n\nFocus the content on the intended product so readers can understand the\nproject without referring to the original AddressBook materials.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":19,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"33b94d557ee3f57134844d9806a7cfc67e25c33c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add project guidance for AI agents","messageBody":"AI agents currently lack shared instructions for working on this project.\n\nWithout project-specific guidance, agents may use the wrong Java version,\noverlook important tests, or follow inconsistent Git practices.\n\nLet\u0027s document the Java 25 requirement, testing expectations, and Git\nconventions in AGENTS.md for all agents to follow.\n\nKeep the instructions in one place and let CLAUDE.md reference them so\ndifferent AI tools apply the same project standards.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":69,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"abe89e03438d30eb14c07094ffb4eadb65cccd27","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix no newline at EOF error","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"b08b4e69506d469867086643e975617d51ea8c40","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #41 from xdJanaut/docs-site-branding","messageBody":"Rename site branding to ClubLogistics","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"4b6cd1782eab1029a3ef5b16d79b64873462ad2d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into update-readme","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"ad8dbb786108acd83bf9fc3b9bdb5164f08086e6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #45 from imgorf/about-us-bug","messageBody":"Fix AboutUs Issues","fileTyp